WEBVTT

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:50.400
Relaxation techniques? Shaori?

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:54.690
You people should just
keep that shit amongst yourselves.

00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:57.950
What do you mean by "you people"?

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:01.200
Everyone but me.

00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:04.040
Everyone but you.

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:08.210
-All of humanity--
-You weaklings can keep to your tricks.

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:13.880
Secret arts, hidden techniques,
inherited mysteries,

00:02:14.340 --> 00:02:15.920
special moves, body mass,

00:02:16.420 --> 00:02:18.130
stamina...

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:20.970
If I were to take these tricks

00:02:21.760 --> 00:02:24.180
and liken them to physical substances,

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:26.270
they're impurities.

00:02:27.310 --> 00:02:29.480
This kind of chatter is too.

00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:42.990
The Sea Emperor...

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:45.490
will be killed!

00:02:51.330 --> 00:02:53.250
This is Yujiro.

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:07.770
I'm not exerting enough strength?

00:03:08.180 --> 00:03:09.230
Come.

00:03:15.190 --> 00:03:16.940
<i>Those techniques...</i>

00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:23.030
<i>are the substances that make up a fight.</i>

00:03:26.990 --> 00:03:28.790
<i>Everything else...</i>

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:30.870
<i>Everything else is...</i>

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:36.460
<i>an impurity.</i>

00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:39.510
He's using the wall.

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:41.300
Shaori's unusable now.

00:03:55.150 --> 00:03:56.310
This is...

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:02.820
This is Yujiro Hanma.

00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:07.580
Baki.

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:09.830
You seem absurdly happy.

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:11.960
Even though his opponent

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:14.830
is an elderly man over 100 years old.

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:17.340
An elderly man?

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:23.170
Don't be ridiculous.

00:04:29.680 --> 00:04:33.350
His opponent is a super martial artist
with a 140-year-long career!

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:36.350
You...

00:04:49.950 --> 00:04:50.870
Don't...

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:54.870
Don't get so full of yourself, brat!

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:57.750
If anyone has a handicap, it's us.

00:05:06.970 --> 00:05:07.890
Old geezer.

00:05:09.510 --> 00:05:12.390
I'll show you what I'm made of.

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:16.230
He plans to finish it.

00:05:20.730 --> 00:05:22.150
Incredible!

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:25.150
The muscles on his back...

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:26.400
It's like...

00:05:28.070 --> 00:05:29.910
the face of a demon!

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:34.660
I see.

00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:38.080
The muscles that make up your back

00:05:38.170 --> 00:05:40.420
form the face of a demon.

00:05:41.790 --> 00:05:45.260
I've been wanting to see it
at least once in my life.

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:47.430
I see.

00:05:47.510 --> 00:05:49.930
So that's what it was.

00:05:50.010 --> 00:05:50.970
He's wrong.

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:52.810
His muscle shape

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:54.930
is completely different from ours.

00:05:55.390 --> 00:05:58.940
The back muscles are said to be
the key to a good strike.

00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:04.440
Your muscle composition
is clearly abnormal.

00:06:07.150 --> 00:06:08.450
Or, in other words,

00:06:09.610 --> 00:06:15.450
you were blessed with a body
that's made to fight.

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:24.710
You arrogantly said that
everyone besides you is a weakling,

00:06:25.130 --> 00:06:27.760
and I planned on ignoring that.

00:06:28.420 --> 00:06:30.720
But you are correct.

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:34.890
<i>Lions, known as the king of beasts,</i>

00:06:35.390 --> 00:06:38.600
<i>don't consider other animals as rivals.</i>

00:06:40.310 --> 00:06:42.110
<i>Everything is just prey.</i>

00:06:43.900 --> 00:06:48.320
The structure between you
and the rest of humanity is the same.

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:50.860
Let's begin.

00:06:51.450 --> 00:06:52.910
The lion versus...

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:54.740
the prey!

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:09.590
<i>Since...</i>

00:07:10.170 --> 00:07:12.760
<i>my birth,</i>

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:19.180
<i>more than a hundred and some years</i>
<i>have passed.</i>

00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:22.400
<i>For 50,000 days,</i>

00:07:23.440 --> 00:07:28.530
<i>I've continued martial arts,</i>
<i>longer than any other being.</i>

00:07:30.990 --> 00:07:33.610
<i>Harder than...</i>

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:38.040
<i>any other.</i>

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:45.460
<i>More than this guy.</i>

00:07:55.970 --> 00:07:56.800
What is this?

00:08:13.570 --> 00:08:15.320
<i>What kind of fight is this?</i>

00:08:19.410 --> 00:08:23.330
It's an original style that
no longer looks like Kenpo.

00:08:29.710 --> 00:08:32.340
This is Kenpo?

00:08:32.880 --> 00:08:34.800
It's what Sea Emperor Kaku is doing.

00:08:35.890 --> 00:08:38.850
It's not Chinese Kenpo nor anything else.

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:46.480
He's not resisting.

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:48.270
Is this...

00:08:49.190 --> 00:08:50.610
...a real fight?

00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:55.820
What?

00:08:55.910 --> 00:08:57.370
He took his hands out.

00:09:00.240 --> 00:09:01.290
Old geezer.

00:09:03.450 --> 00:09:05.120
Isn't that enough?

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:09.130
What?

00:09:10.710 --> 00:09:11.630
<i>There it is.</i>

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:14.630
-What?
-Look.

00:09:17.130 --> 00:09:18.140
His back is...

00:09:21.470 --> 00:09:22.390
It...

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:29.650
It almost looks like a crying face.

00:09:52.040 --> 00:09:52.920
Are...

00:09:54.380 --> 00:09:56.920
Are you an idiot?!

00:10:10.900 --> 00:10:13.480
Are you fucking kidding me?!

00:10:14.400 --> 00:10:15.570
What?

00:10:16.650 --> 00:10:17.700
There's no way.

00:10:22.660 --> 00:10:23.700
There's no way.

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:40.380
Death from old age.

00:11:00.280 --> 00:11:02.740
Why?

00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:05.990
Why at a time like this?

00:11:27.850 --> 00:11:29.390
He kicked the damn bucket.

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:39.570
<i>Was that a win?</i>

00:11:56.540 --> 00:11:57.590
Dear me.

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:00.880
It's a win for martial arts.

00:12:06.640 --> 00:12:08.180
It was impossible.

00:12:08.510 --> 00:12:10.680
My opponent didn't feel human.

00:12:11.980 --> 00:12:16.980
<i>When I was young, I fought</i>
<i>wild animals several times before.</i>

00:12:18.270 --> 00:12:19.690
But think about it.

00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:24.700
He's said to be
the Strongest Creature on Earth, right?

00:12:24.780 --> 00:12:26.990
Master...

00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:29.660
That's not the problem.

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:31.500
You...

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:33.250
were...

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:35.330
alive?

00:12:37.170 --> 00:12:39.420
-Isn't that amazing?
-No, I mean,

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:43.300
the doctor said you died of old age.

00:12:45.510 --> 00:12:48.220
Yes, my heart did indeed stop.

00:12:50.100 --> 00:12:51.970
My pupils were dilated.

00:12:52.310 --> 00:12:55.770
I heard that when my death was confirmed,

00:12:56.100 --> 00:12:59.480
it was indisputable
from a medical standpoint.

00:13:01.230 --> 00:13:03.820
And what happened as a result?

00:13:05.910 --> 00:13:07.450
<i>I stopped his fist.</i>

00:13:11.410 --> 00:13:12.950
<i>If I was hit,</i>

00:13:13.450 --> 00:13:17.290
<i>that fist would have brought upon</i>
<i>certain death.</i>

00:13:18.710 --> 00:13:19.920
Do you understand?

00:13:22.050 --> 00:13:24.260
It's a win for martial arts!

00:13:26.880 --> 00:13:29.260
Are you doubting me?!

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:34.890
One hundred and several dozen years...

00:13:35.890 --> 00:13:39.860
<i>I've diligently refined techniques</i>
<i>for protecting my body.</i>

00:13:40.690 --> 00:13:42.940
<i>One training after another,</i>

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:48.320
<i>my body gradually transformed</i>
<i>little by little.</i>

00:13:48.740 --> 00:13:53.290
<i>Little by little, I got closer to</i>
<i>the perfect martial arts body.</i>

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:56.040
It's now complete.

00:14:00.080 --> 00:14:02.590
There's no better self-defense than death.

00:14:06.380 --> 00:14:09.840
<i>This generally goes for</i>
<i>all matches in this world.</i>

00:14:10.390 --> 00:14:14.270
<i>From games and sports</i>
<i>to battles of life and death...</i>

00:14:14.720 --> 00:14:17.270
<i>if the opponent dies,</i>
<i>it ends with no winner.</i>

00:14:18.980 --> 00:14:21.060
Thus, there's also no loser.

00:14:22.690 --> 00:14:24.070
That's not fair!

00:14:24.320 --> 00:14:25.820
Exactly.

00:14:26.400 --> 00:14:29.570
Martial arts techniques are unfair.

00:14:30.990 --> 00:14:35.370
<i>When insects and small animals</i>
<i>decide they cannot win,</i>

00:14:35.450 --> 00:14:38.080
<i>they act as if they have died.</i>

00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:42.840
You can disapprove and call it unfair.

00:14:44.590 --> 00:14:47.420
<i>But they survive in the end.</i>

00:14:48.920 --> 00:14:49.840
Everyone.

00:14:50.470 --> 00:14:53.350
I have fought with that monster.

00:14:53.970 --> 00:14:55.930
And I am still standing.

00:14:57.180 --> 00:14:58.350
Old man!

00:14:58.930 --> 00:15:01.100
We just got news from Retsu.

00:15:01.520 --> 00:15:02.440
I heard.

00:15:08.070 --> 00:15:10.400
That Sea Emperor sure is amazing.

00:15:16.660 --> 00:15:18.750
<i>Originally, this tournament was</i>

00:15:18.830 --> 00:15:21.290
<i>for attaining</i>
<i>the ultimate title of Sea Emperor.</i>

00:15:22.830 --> 00:15:27.760
<i>It changed into a team battle between</i>
<i>China and the other countries.</i>

00:15:28.340 --> 00:15:31.380
<i>In the end, with an unclear conclusion,</i>

00:15:31.720 --> 00:15:33.510
<i>the tournament came to a close.</i>

00:15:34.680 --> 00:15:39.350
<i>However, the audience walked home</i>
<i>with a bounce in their steps,</i>

00:15:40.350 --> 00:15:43.400
<i>and their expressions looked satisfied.</i>

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:17.550
Damn geezer.

00:16:19.890 --> 00:16:21.810
That was a great Raitai Tournament.

00:16:23.600 --> 00:16:25.270
We were both focused,

00:16:26.230 --> 00:16:27.860
and we both did our best.

00:16:32.070 --> 00:16:34.320
Hey, Sea Emperor Hanma.

00:16:36.820 --> 00:16:39.910
I, Sea Emperor Kaku, approve of you.

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:42.830
You can claim that name with honor.

00:16:43.460 --> 00:16:45.580
No one will object.

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:48.420
Well, even if they did,

00:16:49.290 --> 00:16:53.670
no one in this world would dare
confront you.

00:16:56.840 --> 00:16:58.140
In all of China,

00:16:58.800 --> 00:17:02.350
of all the Chinese martial artists
who gambled their lives,

00:17:03.230 --> 00:17:07.690
only one person can have the title
of Sea Emperor.

00:17:08.940 --> 00:17:10.940
Even if I defeated you,

00:17:11.780 --> 00:17:14.860
no one would consent to me
taking on that name.

00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:17.870
You haven't defeated me, after all.

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:20.490
Whatever, you damn geezer.

00:17:23.330 --> 00:17:25.620
Your feelings alone are enough for me.

00:17:28.750 --> 00:17:29.880
Hey, Ogre.

00:17:35.380 --> 00:17:38.140
Let's fight again in 100 years.

00:17:43.850 --> 00:17:46.770
<i>I'd like to be called that too.</i>

00:17:48.190 --> 00:17:50.940
<i>The Strongest Creature on Earth.</i>

00:18:07.160 --> 00:18:08.290
<i>Winning...</i>

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:12.290
<i>or losing...</i>

00:18:14.380 --> 00:18:16.340
<i>There's more to the story than that.</i>

00:18:19.010 --> 00:18:22.300
<i>You can come up with lots of reasons</i>
<i>for fighting</i>

00:18:23.890 --> 00:18:25.270
<i>and for not fighting.</i>

00:18:29.560 --> 00:18:30.650
<i>That's why I'll do it.</i>

00:18:31.560 --> 00:18:32.730
<i>The time has come!</i>

00:19:18.570 --> 00:19:20.490
AOKIGAHARA SEA OF TREES

00:19:35.840 --> 00:19:37.090
It's been a while.

00:19:42.340 --> 00:19:43.260
Elder Sage.

00:19:46.430 --> 00:19:48.850
<i>This old tree is thousands of years old,</i>

00:19:49.770 --> 00:19:52.730
<i>and Baki has watched over it</i>
<i>since childhood.</i>

00:19:57.360 --> 00:19:58.780
You're tough.

00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:02.450
You kept up with me the whole time.

00:20:04.570 --> 00:20:05.780
What do you want?

00:20:11.960 --> 00:20:12.790
You're...

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:16.880
This area was a starting point for you.

00:20:19.340 --> 00:20:20.800
Is that right?

00:20:21.760 --> 00:20:22.630
Did you

00:20:23.180 --> 00:20:24.300
want something?

00:20:28.890 --> 00:20:30.430
Did you use this?

00:20:43.240 --> 00:20:44.780
Let's have a showdown.

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:53.460
I refuse.

00:20:55.330 --> 00:20:56.380
I won't

00:20:57.080 --> 00:21:00.000
fight you or anyone else.

00:21:01.210 --> 00:21:03.380
There's just one exception.

00:21:04.050 --> 00:21:07.300
Who is that lucky person?

00:21:10.180 --> 00:21:12.430
It's not a story that's worth telling.

00:21:16.270 --> 00:21:17.900
It's just an ugly family quarrel.

00:21:22.990 --> 00:21:24.030
You'll be killed.

00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:29.700
But I'll still do it.

00:21:31.370 --> 00:21:34.620
Some do it because they will win
or run because they will lose.

00:21:35.580 --> 00:21:37.120
But this fight is more than that.

00:21:37.960 --> 00:21:40.130
Being stronger or weaker than someone

00:21:41.170 --> 00:21:43.340
doesn't interest me anymore.

00:21:43.880 --> 00:21:46.380
But you're here, training.

00:21:48.970 --> 00:21:50.220
Don't you know

00:21:51.140 --> 00:21:53.270
what that man is called?

00:21:53.970 --> 00:21:58.150
The Strongest Creature on Earth, right?

00:21:59.730 --> 00:22:00.650
See you.

00:22:06.610 --> 00:22:07.900
<i>Baki Hanma.</i>

00:22:09.660 --> 00:22:12.160
<i>You will fight me one day.</i>

00:22:13.410 --> 00:22:16.160
<i>And it will be you who will want it.</i>

00:23:42.290 --> 00:23:43.210
IDIOTS FROM PLANET STRONG
